claim.claim-text:
providing a sticker comprising a substrate and an adhesive, at least one of the substrate or the adhesive comprising a distribution of elements;
applying at least a portion of the sticker on an object;
extracting orientation information from the portion of the sticker on the object, the orientation information indicating relative spatial orientations of the respective elements of the portion of the sticker on the object; and
generating a unique code for the object based on the orientation information.
